  "body": "## [3.110.0] - 2026-11-12\n\n### Features\n\n- support ZKTeco ZK4500 on Odoo Windows\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- preserve TCP response correlation on invalid frames\n- recover external TCP controller responses\n\n### Other Changes\n\n- Moved “Named Tax Invoice” from the PayTag cart to the first action in Manager Mode. It opens the existing customer dialog, with the credit authorization option still hidden.\n- clarify recovery of the published release queue job\n- scope release documentation reads to the correct GitHub tokens",
